## Endpoints

### 1. List All Reciters
```
GET https://trycloudflare.com.../api/reciters
```

**Response Example:**
```json
{"success": true, "count": 90, "reciters": [
  {"id": "697f30e3ab4bc39dca9672b1", "name": "محمد صديق المنشاوي", "slug": "mohamed-seddiq-al-minshawi"},
  {"id": "6983826b430a2731b0e5cb5c", "name": "محمود خليل الحصري", "slug": "mahmoud-khalil-al-hussary"}
]}
```

### 2. Reciter Info & Sections (only sections WITH tracks)
```
GET https://trycloudflare.com.../api/reciter/{reciter_id}
```

**Example:** `https://trycloudflare.com.../api/reciter/6983826b430a2731b0e5cb5c`

**Response Example:**
```json
{"success": true, "reciter": {
  "id": "6983826b430a2731b0e5cb5c",
  "name": "محمود خليل الحصري",
  "totalTracks": 285,
  "sections": [
    {"id": "hafs-majlis-murattal", "name": "المصحف المرتل حفص المجلس", "actualCount": 114},
    {"id": "mujawwad", "name": "المصحف المجود حلقات", "actualCount": 107}
  ]
}}
```

### 3. Tracks in a Section
```
GET https://trycloudflare.com.../api/tracks/{reciter_id}/{section_id}
```

**Example:** `https://trycloudflare.com.../api/tracks/6983826b430a2731b0e5cb5c/mujawwad`

**Response Example:**
```json
{"success": true, "reciter": "محمود خليل الحصري", "trackCount": 107, "tracks": [
  {"index": 0, "title": "الفاتحة والبقرة 1-46", "url": "https://pub-58f9a46e5bbf494b8b8df795ab4954da.r2.dev/mahmoud-khalil-al-hussary/mujawwad/full/halaqa/01.mp3"}
]}
```

### 4. Single Track Info (with audio URL)
```
GET https://trycloudflare.com.../api/track/{reciter_id}/{section_id}/{index}
```

**Example:** `https://trycloudflare.com.../api/track/6983826b430a2731b0e5cb5c/mujawwad/0`

**Response Example:**
```json
